# Book: Tests/Bugs/FORT-555217-VeryLongIdentifier.versetest:31 (bp_vm_only):
# a class of 976 characters with a method Function; "this class name is ok,
# but the mangled function name will be too large". The Book's Blueprint VM
# refuses it at link time, 3655; no Verse VM twin. OpenVerse admits it and
# prints
#   field 42
# If UEFN 43.12 refuses it (Build Verse Scripts, or the cook of a Verse VM
# session), Epic's shipped toolchain refuses a program OpenVerse runs. Run
# it alone (single mode), not in a batch: Epic's names for it may depend on
# the module that holds it.
Class2__ := class:
    Var_____:int = 42
    Function(Param:int):int = Param

Main():void =
    Obj := Class2__{}
    Print("OVPROBE field {Obj.Var_____}")
